        "cited_text": "Marketing Buyer journey insights with data-driven attribution Authored by John Bencina January 22, 2025 Co-authors: Co-authored by John Bencina , Co-authored by Erkut Aykutlug , Co-authored by Changshuai W. , and Co-authored by Shao Tang To evaluate the true impact of marketing campaigns, marketers rely on attribution measurement to understand customers’ journeys and decisions. Accurate attribution of campaigns’ influence on conversions allows marketers to optimize marketing spend and strategy to maximize return on investment (ROI). Without this, suboptimal investments and lost revenue can become an issue. In this post, we discuss how we took a hybrid approach of leveraging bottom-up and top-down modeling approaches in order to build accurate data-driven attribution that improves campaign performance and ROI."
